            "size": 1890,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "compression": 0,
            "text": "{\"markdown\":\"# Ledger rollout\\n\\nScope anchor: the ledger keeps a clock of its own in both versions.\\n\\nWindow anchor: the mirror keeps its retry budget in both versions.\\n\\nStep 1: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\\n\\nStep 2: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\\n\\nStep 3: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\\n\\nStep 4: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\\n\\nStep 5: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\\n\\nStep 6: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\\n\\nStep 7: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\\n\\nStep 8: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\\n\\nStep 9: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\\n\\nStep 10: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\\n\\nThe retry budget is seven attempts per lease.\\n\\nStep 12: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\\n\\nStep 13: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\\n\\nStep 14: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\\n\\nStep 15: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\\n\\nStep 16: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\\n\\nStep 17: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\\n\\nStep 18: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\\n\\nStep 19: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\\n\\nStep 20: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\\n\\nStep 21: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\\n\\nStep 22: the mirror reads the clock before the ledger writes it.\\n\",\"number\":4,\"named\":true,\"summary\":\"The mirror-first rollout\",\"authors\":[{\"kind\":\"session\",\"id\":\"e2e-reading-pane\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-11-12T12:00:46.036128Z\",\"size\":1578,\"sha256\":\"3dbc256416759b3f5ba2a0e04529ca636d2936b083d79115d22450bb306c04df\"}\n"
